{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>הפעם הב'</b><br>Now this is the dream of the night. She said: \"Upon my bed by nights — many times I saw that I went about the city to seek my beloved, and I asked the watchmen, 'Have you seen him whom my soul loves?' and I saw that I found him.\"" "<b>הפעם הג'</b><br>He said: \"Then was Knesset Israel in darkness, in the night, and she sought the Shekhinah to walk in her midst.\""], :book :song-of-songs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra's commentary on the Canticles" "http://beta.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH002030344/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:44:05.347517130Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}